Simply liking you won't satisfy me

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:10.490
akogare dake ja ume kirenai

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:10.490
Simply admiring you won't satiate me

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:14.870
asa no hikari ga afure dashitara

