I'll courageously say I love you

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:26.730
Marukawa publishing glossary!

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:27.920
Today's term is manuscript handover.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:30.470
I know it's late, but the
manuscript handover is the step...

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.470
...where the editor hands the
manuscript over to the printer.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.740
The term is also used when
the editor hands the text...

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:37.930
...and illustrations to the designer
for creating cover pages, etc.

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.590
I finished! I actually finished this time!

00:23:39.590 --> 00:23:41.590
